msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:263
msgid ""
"Here you can customize the duration of the \"visible bell\" effect being "
"shown."
msgstr "Hier jy kan pasmaak die duur van die \"sigbare klok\" effek te wees vertoon."

